[2.304,"o","\u001b[32m✔ the delivery receipt is authentic \u001b[90m(1.4869ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ bound to the txid the verifier paid: accepted \u001b[90m(0.6297ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ bound to a different txid (replay/transfer): refused \u001b[90m(0.116ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ unbound (no expected settlement): refused, not silently passed \u001b[90m(0.2303ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ wrong payTo / understated amount refused \u001b[90m(0.106ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[2.333,"o","\u001b[32m✔ criterion 1: chunks arrive OUT OF ORDER and each verifies against the root \u001b[90m(10.3392ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[2.333,"o","\u001b[32m✔ criterion 1b: a tampered chunk is rejected \u001b[90m(3.7832ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[2.333,"o","\u001b[32m✔ criterion 1c: the payload reassembles exactly \u001b[90m(3.1553ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[2.334,"o","\u001b[32m✔ criterion 2: every bundle's custody chain verifies across both hops \u001b[90m(8.5147ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
